const mainHtml = "<section class=\"chapter\">\r\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n        <div class=\"chapter-head\">\r\n          <h1>Ijma&rsquo; &mdash; Consensus</h1>\r\n          <p class=\"ch-sub\">2.3 The Qur&rsquo;an in Legal Thinking &middot; the third source of Islamic law, in practice</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <p class=\"lede prose-col\">The clearest example of ijma&rsquo; sits inside Unit 2.2: the decision to compile the Qur&rsquo;an into a single mus-haf was not commanded explicitly by the Qur&rsquo;an or the Prophet &mdash; it was a course of action the senior companions agreed on together, in response to a genuine new problem, using principles drawn from the Qur&rsquo;an and Sunnah to reach it. That is ijma&rsquo; functioning exactly as intended: filling a gap, never contradicting a text.</p>\r\n\r\n        <p class=\"prose-col\">A second historical example: during the Battle of Uhud, the Prophet consulted his companions on whether to defend Madinah from within the city or meet the Makkan army in open ground. He personally favoured staying inside the city, but a majority of the younger companions argued for meeting them outside &mdash; and the Prophet followed the collective view. In the modern era, national and international bodies of Islamic scholars (fiqh councils) continue to issue ijma&rsquo;-based rulings on questions the earliest generations never had to face &mdash; organ donation and Islamic banking are two frequently cited examples.</p>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"box box-elaborate\">\r\n          <p class=\"box-label\">&#9633; Elaborate &mdash; connect it back</p>\r\n          <p>A past-paper (b) question asks: <em>&ldquo;Why is ijma&rsquo; important in the Muslim world today?&rdquo;</em> Without looking anything up, write two sentences that connect ijma&rsquo; to a challenge facing Muslims that did not exist in the seventh century &mdash; something involving modern medicine, modern finance, or modern technology. Naming a real, specific example is worth more marks than a general statement that &ldquo;ijma&rsquo; helps Muslims agree.&rdquo;</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div style=\"max-width:66ch; margin:40px auto 0;\" class=\"prose-col\">\r\n          <h3 style=\"display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap;\">Ready to practise?</h3>\r\n          <p style=\"margin-top:10px; color:var(--ink-soft);\">A short Practice Quiz first, then a graded Quiz once you're confident.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"lesson-pager\">\r\n          <a class=\"pager-link\" href=\"../quran-and-sunnah/quiz.html\"><span class=\"pg-label\">&larr; Back</span><div class=\"pg-title\">The Qur&rsquo;an and the Sunnah Quiz</div></a>\r\n          <a class=\"pager-link next\" href=\"practice.html\"><span class=\"pg-label\">Next &rarr;</span><div class=\"pg-title\">Practice Quiz</div></a>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </section>";
